; Diane Fort — Cup Spirograph Topper G-code
; Food Printing assignment
;
; CUP STRUCTURE:
;   Outline: solid base (layer 1) + circular wall (layers 2+)
;   Fill   : concentric rings inside cup (second material)
;
; Wall layers: 8
; Layer height: 1.0 mm
; Base Z: 5.50 mm
; Wall top Z: 13.50 mm
; Radius: 26.0 mm  (diameter 52.0 mm)
; Center: (100, 100)
; Print speed: 800 mm/min
; Extrusion mult: 0.025
; Continuation after fort fill: first topper layer starts at Z=16.50 mm (fill ended at Z=15.50 mm, inner scale=0.35x, 2 outer rings spaced by 10.0 mm in diameter)

; === INITIALIZATION ===
G21              ; Set units to millimeters
G90              ; Absolute positioning
M82              ; Absolute extrusion mode
; Continuation file: keep printer coordinates from the completed fort print


